keywords:
  - RECD
  - excess3
  - ordinal patterns
  - nested time
  - Systemic Tau
  - complexity
abstract: >-
  Pure-NumPy implementation of nested ordinal conjunction levels (Φ1, Φ2, Φ3),
  continuous excess³ (primary Level-3 hybrid proxy 0.6·Syn + 0.4·Surp),
  phase-shuffle nulls on |Δ excess3|, and λ-weighted Discrete Extramental Clock
  accumulation. Canonical software for the excess³ methods specification.
